:PNLGRP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP   NAME=PRTQRYD.Print Query Definition
:P.This command is used to print the details of a query definition.
QUSRSYS.
:EHELP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP   NAME='PRTQRYD/QRY'.Query Definition
:XH3.QRY - Query Definition
:P.Enter the query to print.
:EHELP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:EPNLGRP.
